 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## Text translation
+
+Open **Translate** in the header (`/devtools-times/translate`) to translate up to 5,000 characters between selected languages. The tool uses the browser's on-device `Translator` API in a secure context (HTTPS or localhost), with language pack download progress, cancellation, language swapping, and copying. The first translation may require an internet connection to download a language pack. Unsupported browsers or language pairs show an explanatory message and disable translation; text is never sent to a remote translation service.
+
+Run the translation lifecycle tests with `node --test tests/translator.test.mjs` (Node 22.18+).
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
